0.01: New App!
0.02: using TS and rollup to bundle
0.03: bug fixes and support bangle 1
0.04: removing TS
0.05: major overhaul; now you customize your calendar based on your location for candle lighting times
0.06: bug fixes and improvements
0.07: fix customizer (skypack CDN 404/CORS - switched to esm.sh), crash from undefined "Upcoming" list item, duplicate layout ids, crash when calendar is exhausted, and non-numeric Location lat/lon
0.08: upgrade @hebcal/core to v6; ship calendar as a separate data file instead of duplicating app.js in the customizer; remove dead code; allow emulator
0.09: compute events on-device using bundled @hebcal/core; removed web customizer; use My Location app for coordinates; added settings for Israel/Diaspora mode; events always current, no expiry
0.10: fix SyntaxError crash on-device by transpiling all ES6+ syntax to ES5 for the Espruino interpreter (@babel/preset-env); add whitelist test guarding the bundle against unsupported syntax/operators
0.11: stub quick-lru to eliminate Map subclassing, Reflect, and regenerator runtime from bundle; all three are unsupported on Espruino
0.12: replace global Map with plain-object stub (@rollup/plugin-inject); tighten global-identifier whitelist to only what is verified in Espruino
0.13: polyfill String.prototype.normalize (not implemented in Espruino) to fix crash on startup
0.14: stub 8 large unused @hebcal modules to shrink bundle from 83 KB to 62 KB (fixes OUT OF MEMORY on Bangle.js 2); add emulator integration test